{"ticker":"MRSH","updated":"2026-10-23T23:19:11Z","profile":{"longName":"Marsh & McLennan Companies, Inc.","shortName":"Marsh","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance Brokers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.corporate.marsh.com","fullTimeEmployees":95000,"marketCap":94239678464,"trailingPE":23.62201,"forwardPE":17.239904,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3114192,"pegRatio":1.74,"targetMeanPrice":205.38095,"targetHighPrice":228.0,"targetLowPrice":180.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.081,"earningsGrowth":0.119,"grossMargins":0.44478,"operatingMargins":0.18403,"profitMargins":0.14199,"totalRevenue":28458999808,"beta":0.585,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":200.325,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":156.6,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.99},"summary":"Marsh & McLennan Companies, Inc., a professional services company, provides advisory services and insurance solutions to clients in the areas of risk, strategy, and people worldwide. The company operates through Risk and Insurance Services, and Consulting segments. The Risk and Insurance Services segment offers risk management services, such as risk management, insurance broking, insurance program management, risk consulting, analytical modeling, and alternative risk financing services. This segment also offers insurance and reinsurance broking, strategic advisory and actuarial services, and analytics solutions. It serves businesses, public entities, insurance companies, associations, professional services organizations, and private clients. The Consulting segment provides health, wealth and career advice, solutions and products; and specialized management, strategic, economic, and brand consulting services. Marsh & McLennan Companies, Inc. was founded in 1871 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","summary_zh":"Marsh & McLennan Companies, Inc. 是一家專業服務公司，為全球風險、策略和人員領域的客戶提供諮詢服務和保險解決方案。該公司透過風險和保險服務以及諮詢部門進行運作。風險和保險服務部門提供風險管理服務，例如風險管理、保險經紀、保險計劃管理、風險諮詢、分析建模和另類風險融資服務。該部門還提供保險和再保險經紀、策略諮詢和精算服務以及分析解決方案。它為企業、公共實體、保險公司、協會、專業服務組織和私人客戶提供服務。諮詢部門提供健康、財富和職業建議、解決方案和產品；以及專業管理、策略、經濟和品牌諮詢服務。 Marsh & McLennan Companies, Inc. 成立於 1871 年，總部位於紐約州紐約市。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險經紀人","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":210.38,"h":211.28,"l":206.97,"c":207.01,"v":1370700},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":206.66,"h":206.93,"l":205.27,"c":206.42,"v":2050500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":206.61,"h":207.64,"l":205.92,"c":206.37,"v":1383600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":206.2,"h":207.01,"l":204.29,"c":206.44,"v":2190300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":206.73,"h":207.53,"l":205.33,"c":205.81,"v":2404900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":205.65,"h":207.19,"l":204.51,"c":205.44,"v":2892600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":204.88,"h":205.72,"l":204.12,"c":205.27,"v":1244000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":205.73,"h":206.97,"l":204.8,"c":206.11,"v":2683800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":205.77,"h":207.08,"l":203.17,"c":203.74,"v":1516900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":202.77,"h":203.68,"l":201.03,"c":203.46,"v":1833500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":202.48,"h":203.58,"l":198.06,"c":201.88,"v":2193900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":201.03,"h":201.48,"l":198.09,"c":198.77,"v":2529200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":198.93,"h":203.47,"l":198.39,"c":203.46,"v":2998900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":202.63,"h":204.35,"l":202.43,"c":202.93,"v":2652500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":203.06,"h":203.72,"l":197.31,"c":198.11,"v":2122700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":197.04,"h":197.81,"l":196.17,"c":196.83,"v":2162700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":197.4,"h":199.87,"l":197.07,"c":197.4,"v":1734300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":196.48,"h":198.44,"l":195.01,"c":196.15,"v":1455500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":197.12,"h":197.94,"l":196.07,"c":196.78,"v":3630000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":196.87,"h":197.48,"l":195.83,"c":197.04,"v":2355800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":197.23,"h":198.37,"l":195.63,"c":197.46,"v":2739100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":196.64,"h":201.08,"l":196.31,"c":199.66,"v":2831300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":200.77,"h":201.72,"l":197.33,"c":197.97,"v":2324500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":199.68,"h":